To achieve the static benchmarking and specific trend lines, I implemented custom DAX measures:

High Risk Count (Static Baseline):
High Risk Count = 
CALCULATE(
    [Total Patients], 
    ALL('ckd dataset'),
    'ckd dataset'[Class] = "positive", 
    'ckd dataset'[Stage] IN {"Stage 4", "Stage 5"}
) + 0

High Risk Trend (Filtered Sparkline):
Used to visualize the distribution of severe cases across specific age demographics (50, 60, 70, 80) while maintaining a unique trend shape.
